T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Principle of Conservation of Electric Charge:) Tj
T*
(   - Electric charge is an invariant, conserved physical quantity. It can neither be created nor) Tj
T*
(   destroyed.) Tj
T*
(   - In any closed volume V bounded by surface S, if the total enclosed charge Q decreases, it) Tj
