(   2. Application of Maxwell's Third Equation \(Del x E = - mu_0 * dH/dt\):) Tj
T*
(   - Evaluate curl of E:) Tj
T*
(   Del x E = i*\(dE_z/dy - dE_y/dz\) + j*\(dE_x/dz - dE_z/dx\) + k*\(dE_y/dx - dE_x/dy\).) Tj
T*
