(>> Solution to Question 13:) Tj
T*
ET
BT
/F1 8.5 Tf
12.5 TL
(   [Problem Statement]: Calculate the time-average Poynting vector for a harmonic plane electromagnetic wave, and prove that energy is equally partitioned between electric and magnetic fields.) Tj
T*
(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. Wave Expressions:) Tj
T*
(   - E\(z,t\) = E_0 * cos\(omega*t - k*z\) i) Tj
T*
(   - H\(z,t\) = H_0 * cos\(omega*t - k*z\) j = \(E_0 / eta\) * cos\(omega*t - k*z\) j) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. Instantaneous Poynting Vector S:) Tj
T*
(   - S = E x H = [ E_0 * cos\(omega*t - k*z\) i ] x [ H_0 * cos\(omega*t - k*z\) j ]) Tj
T*
(   S = E_0 * H_0 * cos^2\(omega*t - k*z\) k = \(E_0^2 / eta\) * cos^2\(omega*t - k*z\) k.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Time-Averaging over a Complete Period T = 2*pi / omega:) Tj
T*
(   - Average of cos^2\(theta\) over one period is 1/2:) Tj
T*
(   <cos^2\(omega*t - k*z\)> = \(1 / T\) * Integral_0^T cos^2\(omega*t - k*z\) dt = 1/2.) Tj
T*
(   - Therefore, time-average Poynting vector:) Tj
T*
(   S_avg = 0.5 * E_0 * H_0 k = 0.5 * \(E_0^2 / eta\) k = 0.5 * epsilon * v * E_0^2 k.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Proof of Equal Energy Partitioning:) Tj
T*
(   - Instantaneous electric energy density: u_E = 0.5 * epsilon * E^2.) Tj
T*
(   Time average: <u_E> = 0.5 * epsilon * E_0^2 * <cos^2> = 0.25 * epsilon * E_0^2.) Tj
T*
(   - Instantaneous magnetic energy density: u_B = 0.5 * mu * H^2.) Tj
T*
(   Time average: <u_B> = 0.5 * mu * H_0^2 * <cos^2> = 0.25 * mu * \(E_0 / eta\)^2.) Tj
T*
(   - Substitute eta = sqrt\(mu / epsilon\):) Tj
T*
(   <u_B> = 0.25 * mu * [ E_0^2 / \(mu / epsilon\) ] = 0.25 * epsilon * E_0^2.) Tj
T*
(   - Comparing: <u_E> = <u_B> = 0.25 * epsilon * E_0^2.) Tj
T*
(   - Total average energy density: <u_total> = <u_E> + <u_B> = 0.5 * epsilon * E_0^2.) Tj
T*
(   - This proves that electromagnetic energy is stored in exactly equal halves between the) Tj
T*
(   electric and magnetic fields.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(--------------------------------------------------------------------------------) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
ET
