T*
(   - \(1\) Del dot E = 0) Tj
T*
(   - \(2\) Del dot H = 0) Tj
T*
(   - \(3\) Del x E = - mu * \(dH / dt\)) Tj
T*
(   - \(4\) Del x H = sigma * E + epsilon * \(dE / dt\)) Tj
T*
