(   - Take curl of Eq \(3\): Del x \(Del x E\) = - mu * d/dt \(Del x H\).) Tj
T*
(   - Substitute Eq \(4\):) Tj
T*
(   Del\(Del dot E\) - Del^2\(E\) = - mu * d/dt [ sigma * E + epsilon * \(dE/dt\) ].) Tj
T*
(   - Since Del dot E = 0:) Tj
T*
(   Del^2\(E\) = mu * sigma * \(dE / dt\) + mu * epsilon * \(d^2E / dt^2\) [Telegrapher's Equation for) Tj
T*
(   E].) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. Time-Harmonic Fields \(d/dt -> j*omega\):) Tj
T*
(   - Del^2\(E\) = [ j*omega*mu*sigma - omega^2*mu*epsilon ] E = gamma^2 * E,) Tj
T*
(   where gamma is the complex propagation constant: gamma = alpha + j*beta = sqrt\() Tj
T*
(   j*omega*mu*\(sigma + j*omega*epsilon\) \).) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   4. Expressions for alpha and beta:) Tj
T*
(   - Squaring both sides: \(alpha + j*beta\)^2 = alpha^2 - beta^2 + 2*j*alpha*beta = -) Tj
T*
(   omega^2*mu*epsilon + j*omega*mu*sigma.) Tj
T*
(   - Equating real and imaginary parts:) Tj
T*
(   \(i\) beta^2 - alpha^2 = omega^2 * mu * epsilon) Tj
T*
(   \(ii\) 2*alpha*beta = omega * mu * sigma) Tj
T*
(   - Solving the coupled equations yields:) Tj
T*
(   alpha = omega * sqrt\( \(mu*epsilon / 2\) * [ sqrt\(1 + \(sigma / \(omega*epsilon\)\)^2\) - 1 ] \)) Tj
T*
(   beta = omega * sqrt\( \(mu*epsilon / 2\) * [ sqrt\(1 + \(sigma / \(omega*epsilon\)\)^2\) + 1 ] \).) Tj
T*
