(   4. \(c\) Magnetic Field Expression H\(z,t\):) Tj
T*
(   - For a wave propagating along +z with E polarized along +i:) Tj
T*
(   Direction of H = k_hat x E_hat = k x i = j.) Tj
T*
(   - Amplitude: H_0 = E_0 / eta_0 = 120 / 377 = 0.3183 A/m.) Tj
T*
(   - Expression: H\(z,t\) = 0.3183 * cos\(6*pi*10^8 t - 6.283*z\) j A/m.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   5. \(d\) Time-Average Poynting Vector S_avg:) Tj
T*
(   - S_avg = 0.5 * E_0 * H_0 k = 0.5 * 120 * 0.3183 k = 19.1 W/m^2 k.) Tj
T*
(   - Alternatively: S_avg = 0.5 * \(E_0^2 / eta_0\) = 0.5 * \(14400 / 377\) = 19.1 W/m^2 along +z.) Tj
T*
() Tj
