(   [Detailed Step-by-Step Answer]:) Tj
T*
(   1. \(a\) Time-Average Poynting Vector Magnitude S_avg:) Tj
T*
(   - Transmitter radiates power P = 50 kW = 50,000 W uniformly over a sphere of radius R = 10,000) Tj
T*
(   m.) Tj
T*
(   - Sphere surface area: A_sphere = 4 * pi * R^2 = 4 * pi * \(10,000\)^2 = 1.2566 x 10^9 m^2.) Tj
T*
(   - S_avg = P / A_sphere = 50,000 / \(1.2566 x 10^9\) = 3.979 x 10^-5 W/m^2 = 39.79 microwatts/m^2.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   2. \(b\) Electric and Magnetic Field Amplitudes:) Tj
T*
(   - S_avg = 0.5 * \(E_0^2 / eta_0\) => E_0 = sqrt\( 2 * eta_0 * S_avg \).) Tj
T*
(   - E_0 = sqrt\( 2 * 377 * 3.979 x 10^-5 \) = sqrt\( 0.0300 \) = 0.1732 V/m = 173.2 mV/m.) Tj
T*
(   - H_0 = E_0 / eta_0 = 0.1732 / 377 = 4.594 x 10^-4 A/m = 459.4 microamperes/m.) Tj
T*
(   - Peak B field: B_0 = mu_0 * H_0 = 4*pi x 10^-7 * 4.594 x 10^-4 = 5.77 x 10^-10 T = 0.577 nT.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
(   3. \(c\) Total Stored EM Energy in Volume V:) Tj
T*
(   - Volume V = 100 m * 100 m * 50 m = 500,000 m^3.) Tj
T*
(   - Average energy density: <u_total> = S_avg / c = \(3.979 x 10^-5 W/m^2\) / \(3.0 x 10^8 m/s\) =) Tj
T*
(   1.326 x 10^-13 J/m^3.) Tj
T*
(   - Total stored energy: U = <u_total> * V = 1.326 x 10^-13 * 500,000 = 6.63 x 10^-8 Joules =) Tj
T*
(   66.3 nanojoules.) Tj
T*
() Tj
